classDiagram
  accTitle: C4 L4 - Reconciliation component code
  accDescr: Selected classes of the reconciliation component. Policies are constructed by Engine. Provider and PairRepository contracts are injected. Store is the external persistence implementation.
  direction LR
  class Engine {
    +run() array
    +resolve(id, source, conflictHash=null) void
    +approve(string id, string hash, string reason) void
    +retry(string id) void
  }
  class MergePolicy {
    <<pure policy>>
    +decide(baseline, github, zendesk) MergeDecision
  }
  class GovernancePolicy {
    <<pure policy>>
    +review(array pair) array
    +validatePlan(array plan) void
  }
  class RetryPolicy {
    <<pure policy>>
    +afterFailure(attempts, retryable, retryAfter, now, jitter) RetryDecision
  }
  class PairRepository {
    <<injected interface>>
    +withExclusiveLock(callable operation) mixed
    +get(string id) array
    +update(string id, array values) void
    +event(string id, string type, array details) void
  }
  class Provider {
    <<injected interface>>
    +fetch(string id) Record
    +patch(string id, array changes, Record expected) void
  }
  class Record {
    <<value object>>
    +array fields
    +string version
    +bool writable
  }
  class Store {
    <<external SQLite adapter>>
  }

  Engine *-- MergePolicy : constructs
  Engine *-- GovernancePolicy : constructs
  Engine *-- RetryPolicy : constructs
  Engine ..> PairRepository : injected business boundary
  Engine ..> Provider : two injected field providers
  Provider ..> Record : returns and checks
  Store ..|> PairRepository : implements
  note for Engine "Key: solid diamond = owned policy; dashed arrow = dependency;<br/>hollow triangle = interface implementation.<br/>Selected methods only; external collaborators are not additional Engine services."
